go-beanstalk transcript provenance

go_reference_test.mbt translates the literal mock command/reply transcripts in:
https://github.com/beanstalkd/go-beanstalk/blob/52e4a01c453b3de42105389beb2374f256751064/conn_test.go

Pinned upstream revision: 52e4a01c453b3de42105389beb2374f256751064
Translated cases: TestDeleteMissing, TestUse, TestWatchIgnore, TestBury,
TestTubeKickJob, TestDelete, TestListTubes, TestPeek, TestPeekTwice, TestRelease,
TestStats, TestStatsJob, and TestTouch. Name validation cases TestNameTooLong,
TestNameEmpty, and TestNameBadChar are translated separately.

The original wire bytes and expected meanings are preserved. The surrounding
test harness is rewritten in MoonBit and repeats decoding at every split point.
TestReserveJob is excluded because reserve-job is not currently exposed.
TestNegativeDuration is excluded because the API takes unsigned seconds.
These mock transcripts establish an independent oracle, not live-server or
cross-language interoperability evidence.

